<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Payment Receipt - {{eventTitle}}</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background: #f8fafc; color: #1e293b; margin: 0; padding: 24px; }
    .card { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); }
    .header { background: #0284c7; color: #ffffff; padding: 28px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; }
    .header p { margin: 0; font-size: 15px; opacity: 0.9; }
    .content { padding: 32px; }
    .info-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .info-table td { padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; font-size: 15px; }
    .info-table td.label { color: #64748b; font-weight: 500; width: 35%; }
    .info-table td.value { color: #0f172a; font-weight: 600; }
    .badge { display: inline-block; padding: 4px 10px; background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; }
    .footer { padding: 20px 32px; background: #f8fafc; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #94a3b8; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Payment Received</h1>
      <p>Test Mode Transaction Receipt</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p style="font-size: 16px; margin-top: 0;">Hi <strong>{{studentName}}</strong>,</p>
      <p>Your payment for <strong>{{{eventTitle}}}</strong> has been processed successfully in sandbox test mode.</p>

      <table class="info-table">
        <tr>
          <td class="label">Event</td>
          <td class="value">{{{eventTitle}}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="label">Amount Paid</td>
          <td class="value">₹{{amount}} <span class="badge">TEST MODE</span></td>
        </tr>
        {{#if transactionId}}
        <tr>
          <td class="label">Transaction ID</td>
          <td class="value">{{transactionId}}</td>
        </tr>
        {{/if}}
        <tr>
          <td class="label">Date</td>
          <td class="value">{{paidAt}}</td>
        </tr>
      </table>

      <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #64748b;">
        Your registration is now verified. You can view your pass in your Eventora Passport.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>Eventora Campus Event Notification Engine &bull; Automated System Notice</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
